@name  fx-torch-flame
@scale 16
@size  9x15
# A six-frame flame for torches, sconces, braziers and campfires. It is the
# light, so it has no outline: the red rim is the edge. The base (rows 9-14)
# barely moves -- it is pinned to the fuel -- while the upper body sways and
# throws off tongues that detach and rise, so the loop reads as burning rather
# than as a shape wobbling. The lit (left) side carries amber, the right side
# an extra step of orange, the same upper-left light as the rest of the world.
#
# @recolor makes fx-torch-flame-radiant (a temple's holy fire), -necrotic
# (a crypt's grave-light), -cold, -arcane... one sprite per damage type.
@anchor 4,15
@point base 4,14
@ramp  fire fire 5 01234

@recolor fire magic
@lint skip=pillow,light,stray,jaggy

@frame burn-0 dur=100
....0....
....1....
...12....
...121...
..1221...
..12221..
..12321..
.123221..
.1223221.
.1223221.
.1234221.
.1234421.
.1223221.
..12321..
...121...

